// spec: kpp has no preprocessor (design.md 7): a directive in kpp source is an error, never skipped. Found writing
// docs/differences-from-cpp.md (2026-11-06): the lexer's Directive token is dropped, so `#include` does nothing, any
// `#word` is accepted, and the lines between `#ifdef NOPE` and `#endif` are compiled: this program returned 1.
